WEBVTT

00:37:57.390 --> 00:38:00.136
Chris says it started
when the fire chief publicly stated

00:38:00.160 --> 00:38:02.856
his commitment
to supporting first responders

00:38:02.880 --> 00:38:04.406
throughout the organization.

00:38:04.430 --> 00:38:06.446
CM: And our fire chief
and operations chief

00:38:06.470 --> 00:38:08.216
both told all of those men and women

00:38:08.240 --> 00:38:11.296
that if they raise their hand,
they will be taken care of

00:38:11.320 --> 00:38:12.816
and will never lose their job.

00:38:12.840 --> 00:38:16.388
And so that was a superpowerful moment
for us as an organization.

00:38:16.412 --> 00:38:18.651
And if you feel safe,

00:38:18.675 --> 00:38:22.156
if you know that your organization
is standing behind you,

00:38:22.180 --> 00:38:25.437
you can really weather more
and perform better.

00:38:25.461 --> 00:38:32.461
(Music)